# 21.5 Table Schema

| Column | Data Type | Nullable | Default | Description |
|---------|-----------|----------|----------|-------------|
| id | UUID | No | gen_random_uuid() | Primary Key |
| session_id | UUID | No | — | Parent chat session |
| profile_id | UUID | No | — | Owner |
| role | message_role_enum | No | — | User / Assistant / System |
| status | message_status_enum | No | pending | Processing state |
| content | TEXT | No | — | Message content |
| cited_chunks | JSONB | Yes | NULL | Referenced chunk IDs |
| retrieved_documents | JSONB | Yes | NULL | Retrieved document IDs |
| prompt_tokens | INTEGER | Yes | NULL | Prompt token count |
| completion_tokens | INTEGER | Yes | NULL | Completion token count |
| total_tokens | INTEGER | Yes | NULL | Total tokens |
| response_time_ms | INTEGER | Yes | NULL | End-to-end latency |
| planner_used | BOOLEAN | No | TRUE | Planner executed |
| reviewer_used | BOOLEAN | No | TRUE | Reviewer executed |
| streaming_enabled | BOOLEAN | No | TRUE | Response streamed |
| model_name | VARCHAR(100) | Yes | NULL | LLM provider/model |
| created_at | TIMESTAMPTZ | No | NOW() | Creation timestamp |
| updated_at | TIMESTAMPTZ | No | NOW() | Last update |

