# 21.13 Response Latency

Each assistant response stores its total generation time.

Example

```text
User Message

↓

2.4 seconds

↓

Assistant Response
```

Future dashboards may visualize:

- Average latency
- Slow requests
- Model performance
- Retrieval performance

