# 21.14 Streaming Responses

When streaming is enabled,

assistant responses are delivered token-by-token.

```text
LLM

↓

Token 1

↓

Token 2

↓

Token 3

↓

Complete Response

↓

Save Final Message
```

Streaming improves perceived responsiveness while preserving the final response in the database.

