# 21.15 AI Pipeline Integration

Each assistant message represents the output of the complete AI pipeline.

```text
User Message

↓

Intent Detection

↓

Planner Agent

↓

Prompt Builder

↓

Retriever

↓

Context Assembly

↓

LLM

↓

